        "cooked": "<p>This is an organized place to find all my guides to the environments. Will update as new guides become available.</p>\n<p><strong>Core Set</strong></p>\n<p>Ruins of Atlantis</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/the-survival-guide-to-wagner-mars-base-7580\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Wagnar Mars Base</a></p>\n<p>Megalopolis</p>\n<p>Insula Primalis</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Rook City</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/a-survival-guide-to-rook-city-7442\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Rook City</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/a-survival-guide-to-pike-industrial-complex-7444\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Pike Industrial Complex</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Infernal Relics</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/a-survival-guide-to-the-realm-of-discord-7439\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Realm of Discord</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/a-survival-guide-to-the-tomb-of-anubis-7436\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Tomb of Anubis</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Shattered Timelines</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/survival-guide-to-time-cataclysm-7477\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Time Cataclysm</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/the-survival-guide-to-the-block-7579\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">  The Block</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Vengeance Environments</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/the-survival-guide-to-freedom-tower-7452\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"> <strong>Freedom Tower</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/the-survival-guide-to-mobile-defense-platform-7476\" data-bbcode=\"t