        "raw": "This is an organized place to find all my guides to the environments. Will update as new guides become available.\n\n<strong>Core Set</strong>\n\nRuins of Atlantis\n\n[url=https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/the-survival-guide-to-wagner-mars-base-7580]Wagnar Mars Base[/url]\n\nMegalopolis\n\nInsula Primalis\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Rook City</strong>\n\n [Url=https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/a-survival-guide-to-rook-city-7442]Rook City[/url] \n\n [url=  https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/a-survival-guide-to-pike-industrial-complex-7444]Pike Industrial Complex[/url] \n\n&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Infernal Relics</strong>\n\n[url=https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/a-survival-guide-to-the-realm-of-discord-7439]Realm of Discord[/url]\n\n[url=https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/a-survival-guide-to-the-tomb-of-anubis-7436]Tomb of Anubis[/url]\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Shattered Timelines</strong>\n\n[url= https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/survival-guide-to-time-cataclysm-7477]Time Cataclysm[/url] \n\n [url=  https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/the-survival-guide-to-the-block-7579]  The Block[/url] \n\n&nbsp;\n\n<strong style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Vengeance Environments</strong>\n\n[url= https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/the-survival-guide-to-freedom-tower-7452] <strong>Freedom Tower[/url]</strong>\n\n[url=https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/the-survival-guide-to-mobile-defense-platform-7476]Mobile Defense Platform[/url]\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Wrath of the Cosmos</strong>\n\nDok&#39;Thorath Capital\n\nThe Enclave of the Endlings\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Mini Expansions</strong>\n\nSilver Gulch 1883\n\nThe Final Wasteland\n\nOmnitron IV\n",
